@startuml flows
skinparam Handwritten false
skinparam Shadowing false

actor User
participant "Web Page / DOM" as Page
participant "Content Script (Grammarly-check.js)" as Content
participant "Background SW (Grammarly-bg.js)" as BG
participant "UI Panel (popup/sidePanel)" as UI
participant "AI Iframe App (Inkwell)" as Inkwell
database "IndexedDB / chrome.storage" as DB
boundary "Grammarly Remote CAPI" as CAPI

User -> Page : Types text / Selects text
Page -> Content : Listens to input / selection events
Content -> Content : Extracts DOM text & metadata
Content -> BG : Sends text context (Port/Message)
BG -> DB : Stores document state / telemetry
BG -> CAPI : Connects freews / gdocs WebSockets
BG -> CAPI : Sends text stream to check
CAPI --> BG : Returns grammar corrections
BG --> Content : Relays alert markers & suggestions
Content -> Page : Injects underline markers & correction cards

User -> UI : Opens Popup / SidePanel
UI -> BG : Requests preferences / state
BG -> DB : Reads from storage (isSidePanelOpen)
BG --> UI : Returns UI state

User -> Inkwell : Uses Rewrite Assistant / Prompt
Inkwell -> CAPI : Connects wss://capi.grammarly.com/fpws
Inkwell -> CAPI : Sends selection context & rewrite prompt
CAPI --> Inkwell : Returns streamed generative AI response
Inkwell --> Page : Injects rewritten text into editor

BG -> CAPI : GNAR tracking / Telemetry uploads
@enduml
